{
  "comment": [
    "U13 device-native boot recovery + BoatAttack overlay (demo autostart), v2. (1) westlake-u13-recover runs at the",
    "**post-fs-data** bootstage (after /data, BEFORE the boot-stage foundation/AMS that would trigger the ondemand",
    "appspawn-x) and replays the pinned 56 U13 baseline mounts (source-relabel-before-bind), then preserves init's",
    "ondemand appspawn-x listener (NEVER starts/execs the daemon, NEVER launches an app); (2) after it sets",
    "sys.westlake.demo.u13.ready, westlake-u13-boat-overlay binds the BoatAttack shared overlay (C8 adapter + C9 jar)",
    "and the 3 app-private libs. v2 last-mile (APPSPAWN-LASTMILE-PLAN-v2.md): init latches SERVICE_ATTR_INVALID if",
    "stat(/system/bin/appspawn-x) EVER fails at a ServiceStart (init_common_service.c:674-692), with no clear path. The",
    "0B mount points exist at boot (no ENOENT), so the latch came from a stat-fail moment during mount churn. v2: run at",
    "post-fs-data (before the boot-stage foundation/AMS first triggers the ondemand appspawn-x) and bind the real U13",
    "appspawn-x WITHOUT any umount (stat stays continuous) -> the first ServiceStart execs real bytes, never latched.",
    "recover journals dmesg+timestamps to /data so a future invalid line can be pinned. DELTA vs donor: NO setenforce 0;",
    "caps minimal (DAC_OVERRIDE/CHOWN/FOWNER/SYS_ADMIN, no SYS_PTRACE/SETPCAP). Can't run sealed -> STOP for outer review."
  ],
  "jobs": [
    {
      "name": "post-fs-data",
      "cmds": [ "start westlake-u13-recover" ]
    },
    {
      "name": "param:westlake-u13-boat-overlay-start",
      "condition": "sys.westlake.demo.u13.ready=true",
      "cmds": [ "start westlake-u13-boat-overlay" ]
    }
  ],
  "services": [
    {
      "name": "westlake-u13-recover",
      "path": [ "/system/bin/sh", "/system/etc/westlake-u13-recover.sh" ],
      "uid": "root",
      "gid": [ "root", "system" ],
      "caps": [ "DAC_OVERRIDE", "CHOWN", "FOWNER", "SYS_ADMIN" ],
      "start-mode": "condition",
      "once": 1,
      "sandbox": 0,
      "secon": "u:r:su:s0"
    },
    {
      "name": "westlake-u13-boat-overlay",
      "path": [ "/system/bin/sh", "/system/etc/westlake-u13-boat-overlay.sh" ],
      "uid": "root",
      "gid": [ "root", "system" ],
      "caps": [ "DAC_OVERRIDE", "CHOWN", "FOWNER", "SYS_ADMIN" ],
      "start-mode": "condition",
      "once": 1,
      "sandbox": 0,
      "secon": "u:r:su:s0"
    }
  ]
}
